sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant B as booking-service
  participant R as room-service
  participant P as payment-service
  participant X as RabbitMQ
  participant N as notification-service
  C->>B: POST /bookings (Idempotency-Key)
  B->>R: hold room (15 min, price)
  B->>P: create payment
  B->>X: booking.created (outbox)
  C->>P: confirm payment (simulated / Razorpay)
  P->>X: payment.succeeded (outbox)
  X->>B: booking.payment-events
  B->>R: confirm allocation
  B->>X: booking.confirmed (outbox)
  X->>N: notification.events
  N->>N: e-mail once per event (confirmation, receipt)
